Acknowledgements
----------------

protege-js is an independent Node.js reimplementation of the non-UI core of
Protégé (https://protege.stanford.edu/), which is developed by the Stanford
Center for Biomedical Informatics Research and distributed under the BSD
2-Clause license (Copyright (c) 2014, The Board of Trustees of Leland Stanford
Junior University). protege-js is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Stanford University or the Protégé team. "Protégé" is a trademark
of Stanford University; the name "protege-js" is used for descriptive purposes
only.

The OWL 2 RL rule set implements the W3C recommendation:
  OWL 2 Web Ontology Language Profiles (Second Edition)
  https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-profiles/
  Copyright (c) W3C (MIT, ERCIM, Keio, Beihang).

Sample ontologies under sample/ontologies/ (BFO, OGMS, IAO, RO-core) are
redistributed from the OBO Foundry under CC-BY 4.0 / CC0 1.0; see
sample/README.md for sources and attribution.
